# Secrets
# This file must stay tracked. It is the only secret protection a fresh clone gets,
# and every example directory asks contributors to drop real keys into secret/.
# Patterns without a slash match at any depth.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
secret/
fordefi_secret/
*.pem
*.key
agent-private-key*.json
# Public keys are legitimately tracked (webhook/API-approver signature verification).
# Keep this exception narrow: a broad `*public*.pem` would also re-include names like public-and-private.pem.
!*public_key*.pem


# Lockfiles — patterns without a slash match at any depth.
package-lock.json
